{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 40, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "To journey through the realm of Nippon, behold, a sojourn's tale thusly rendered, in the manner of the Bard:\n\nFair traveler, in the land of rising sun, thou shalt first set foot in the capital city of Tokyo, where modern marvels and ancient traditions dance a lively ballet. In Shinjuku, amidst the neon lights, dost thou partake of the culinary delights, and in the heart of the city, dost thou visit the grandeur of the Imperial Palace, where history and majesty converge.\n\nVenturing forth, to Kyoto, the city of a thousand temples, dost thou next wander, where the beauty of nature and the serenity of Zen Buddhism embrace the soul. In Kyoto, dost thou explore the Kinkaku-ji, the Golden Pavilion, and the Philosopher's Path, where contemplation and beauty intertwine.\n\nContinuing thy journey, to the city of Osaka, the culinary capital of Japan, dost thou seek the savory delights of takoyaki and okonomiyaki, and the grandeur of Osaka Castle, where the past and present mingle in a tapestry of splendor.\n\nFinally, to the serene landscapes of Nara and its ancient capitals, dost thou venture, where deer roam freely and the legacy of a former capital thrives in the form of majestic temples and serene parks.\n\nThus, in the land of Nippon, dost thou experience the richness of culture, the beauty of nature, and the warmth of its people, in a journey that shall forever remain within thy heart.", "logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -2.512735366821289}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -2.4249799251556396}, {"token": " through", "logprob": -0.7475548982620239}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.28925031423568726}, {"token": " realm", "logprob": -3.9525535106658936}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.00541861355304718}, {"token": " Nippon", "logprob": -0.7937899827957153}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.14882540702819824}, {"token": " behold", "logprob": -1